# id|winetricks verb|name|description
COMPONENTS='vcrun2022|vcrun2022|Visual C++ 2015-2022|Runtime most modern Windows apps and games need
dotnet48|dotnet48|.NET Framework 4.8|Older .NET apps and launchers (slow install)
dotnetdesktop8|dotnetdesktop8|.NET 8 Desktop Runtime|Newer .NET apps
d3dx9|d3dx9|DirectX 9 libraries (d3dx9)|Older games built with DirectX 9
